OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA fine
OL,6,Fevening in the east, but cloud and
OL,7,Fpatchy rain will move into the west,
OL,8,Fbefore spreading eastwards overnight.
OL,9,FA mild if not rather humid night to
OL,10,Fcome.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FA rather grey start with some
OL,13,Fpatchy rain or drizzle, especially
OL,14,Fover hills. Turning brighter towards
OL,15,Flunchtime but rain arriving overnight.
OL,16,FFeeling a little fresher with
OL,17,Ftemperatures nearer to average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
