OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FEarly
OL,6,Frain clearing to sunnier spells on
OL,7,FTuesday. Mostly fine and dry Wednesday
OL,8,Fand initially Thursday, before some
OL,9,Fpatchy rain arrives later. Feeling a
OL,10,Flittle cool for early September.
